Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): preserve mixed notice constituents and model
 sidecars [daveey]

Retain validated display/model spans when ordinary user input shares an alternation-repair run with repeated notices. Rewrite only repair-owned metadata during snapshot-matched persistence, preserve the current notice override, and keep normal compaction retirement. Tests cover both orders, interleaved notices, SQLite reload, three compaction surfaces, stale spans and malformed carriers.
